 "solution": "\\(\\cos C=(a^2+b^2-c^2)/(2ab)=1/\\sqrt2\\)，所以C=π/4。由正弦定理，\\(\\sin A=a\\sin C/c=2/\\sqrt{13}\\)。\n\\(\\cos A=(b^2+c^2-a^2)/(2bc)=3/\\sqrt{13}\\)，故 \\(\\sin2A=12/13,\\cos2A=5/13\\)。于是 \\(\\sin(2A+\\pi/4)=(12/13+5/13)/\\sqrt2=17\\sqrt2/26\\)。",
 "explanation": {
